    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WINE SELECTIONS\nIn order to continually present the finest choice of wines,\nwe will occasionally offer special selections in place of the listed wines.\nSPARKLING WINE\nPaul Cheneau Brut Blanc de Blancs\nToasty, smoky aromas and flavors give this sparkler depth\non the palate, yet bright acidity keeps it crisp and refreshing.\nFRENCH WHITE WINE\nVilla Mt. Eden Grand Reserve 1996 Chardonnay\nToasted grain and clove aromas mix with notes of peach, pear\nand other ripe fruits with a hint of butterscotch and a long, full finish.\nRED WINE\nFrescobaldi 1996 Remole Chianti\nA well-balanced dry red wine with an intense ruby-red color\nwith a rich, earthy scent and hints of sweet violet.\nCortinental Airlines"
